  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kosovo&apos;s European Integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support Kosovo&apos;s public instittutions administrating the implementation of the SAA in nine chapters: 4, 9, 10, 15, 18, 19, 27, 28 and 32. The main goal is to increase human capacities and expertise of the public administration to implement and enforce the national legislation aligned with the acquis in targeted areas and support on approximation of the national legislation with the EU acquis in targeted areas.</narrative>
  </description>
